  "original_source_blocks": [
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/0",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#2"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0204#2",
          "page": 204,
          "pointer": "/blocks/1",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "我们导出与三个量（物体到透镜的距离 $d$，像到透镜的距",
              "离 $f$ 及焦距 $F$）有关的公式："
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/1",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#3"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0204#3",
          "page": 204,
          "pointer": "/blocks/2",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": true,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "由于 $\\triangle ABF$ 和 $\\triangle DOF$ 相似（见图179），得出",
              "$\\frac{\\lvert OD\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert OF\\rvert}{\\lvert BF\\rvert}$",
              "因为 $\\lvert OD\\rvert=\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert$，则",
              "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert OF\\rvert}{\\lvert BF\\rvert}=\\frac{F}{d-F}$　（6.15）",
              "此外，由于 $\\triangle COF$ 和 $\\triangle A_1B_1F$ 相似，得出：",
              "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert OC\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert B_1F\\rvert}{\\lvert OF\\rvert}$",
              "考虑到 $\\lvert OC\\rvert=\\lvert AB\\rvert$，可以写出：",
              "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{f-F}{F}$　（6.16）",
              "现在我们使等式（6.15）的右端和（6.16）的右端相等：",
              "$\\frac{F}{d-F}=\\frac{f-F}{F}$",
              "由此得",
              "$F^2=fd-fF-Fd+F^2$",
              "或者　$fF+Fd=fd$",
              "用乘积 $Ffd$ 去除上式中的各项，得到：",
              "$\\frac{1}{d}+\\frac{1}{f}=\\frac{1}{F}$　（6.17）",
              "或者　$\\frac{1}{d}+\\frac{1}{f}=D$　（6.18）"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/2",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#1"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#1",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/0",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "关系式（6.17）或（6.18）叫做**薄透镜公式**. 量 $d$，$f$ 和 $F$ 可",
              "以是正值，也可以是负值. 我们不加证明地指出，在应用透镜",
              "公式时，需要根据以下规则在各项前面标上符号. 如果透镜",
              "是会聚透镜，那么它的焦点是实焦点，并且项 $\\frac{1}{|F|}$ 前面的符号",
              "为“正”. 如果是发散透镜，$F<0$，并且公式（6.17）右边将是",
              "负值 $-\\frac{1}{|F|}$. 如果像是实像，项 $\\frac{1}{|f|}$ 的符号为“正”，如是虚",
              "像则符号为“负”. 最后，在实发光点的情况下，项 $\\frac{1}{|d|}$ 前的符",
              "号为“正”，如果发光点是虚的（即射到透镜上的会聚光束延长",
              "线交于一点），则项 $\\frac{1}{|d|}$ 前的符号为“负”."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/3",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#2"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#2",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/1",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "当 $F$，$f$ 或者 $d$ 为未知时，在相应的项 $\\frac{1}{F}$、$\\frac{1}{f}$ 或 $\\frac{1}{d}$ 前的符",
              "号为“正”. 但如果在计算出的焦距或者透镜到像的距离或者",
              "透镜到光源的距离的结果中得出负值，那么就意味着焦点、像",
              "或者光源是虚的."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/4",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#3"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#3",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/2",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "**透镜的放大率**　透镜所成的像通常与物体的大小不同.",
              "人们用**放大率**来说明物体和像大小的差异."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/5",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#4"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#4",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/3",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "**像的线度与物体线度之比叫做线放大率.**"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/6",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#5"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#5",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/4",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "为求出线放大率，我们再返回来看图 179. 如果物体 $AB$",
              "的高度为 $h$，而像 $A_1B_1$ 的高度为 $H$，那么",
              "$\\Gamma=\\frac{H}{h}$",
              "是线放大率."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/7",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#6",
        "p0206#1"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0205#6",
          "page": 205,
          "pointer": "/blocks/5",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": true,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "由于 $\\triangle OAB$ 与 $\\triangle OA_1B_1$ 相似，可导出"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0206#1",
          "page": 206,
          "pointer": "/blocks/0",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": true,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "$\\frac{H}{h}=\\frac{|f|}{|d|}$"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pointer": "/prose/8",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#2"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0206#2",
          "page": 206,
          "pointer": "/blocks/1",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "因此，透镜放大率",
              "$\\Gamma=\\frac{|f|}{|d|}$ (6.19)"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
